Puggy Wargmonster_name_5222Orc Glow Nosemonster_name_5223Powdered Orcmonster_name_5224Christmas Party Orcmonster_name_5225Exhausted Screenwriterdot_standard_mode_description�Mysterious doors, nasty monsters and powerful bosses await you in this mode. But in the end you will receive <info>a Legendary item</info> for all your efforts!"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_1xOnly for particularly efficient treasure hunters! <info>Chests, monsters</info> and <info>special rooms</info> grant you"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_3aYou will also get <info>3 Legendary items</info> after defeating the final boss in the last room.dot_multi_reward_textQYou have found %1 items. Decide what you want to do with them before you move on.event_name_valentineValentine's Blessingitem_type_06_class_1_pic_068�Helmet of Rose-Colored Vision|"With this helmet even the most horrible<br>opponent suddenly looks quite lovely."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_06_class_2_pic_068SLove Antennas|"Ideal for locating distracted love dorks."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_06_class_3_pic_068CRuby Hood|"To steal hearts and sow love."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_1_pic_068�Love Kicks|"Clomp your opponents into the ground and leave a<br>heart-shaped sole print on their stunned face."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_2_pic_068PHeart Shoes|"With these shoes you walk on cloud nine."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_3_pic_068fInspiring Boots|"With the power of love only your<br>pride stands in your way." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_03_class_1_pic_068�Steel Plates of the Strengthened Heart|"True love won't protect you from heartache,<br>but these steel plates will." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_03_class_3_pic_068sSmooth Negligé|"Certainly protects you from many things, but not from<br>passionate looks". - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_1_pic_068kHeart Beaters|"Love must be shared, and these gloves spread<br>it with every punch." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_2_pic_068XTasteful Gloves|"Protects your hands from melting chocolates."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_3_pic_068`Love Spiral|"All that glitters is not gold, but there is<br>love inside." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_07_class_2_pic_068QLove Potion Leather Strap|"For the pragmatic romantic."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_02_class_1_pic_068VShield of Intimate Distance|"Keeps any pushy suitor at bay."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_01_class_1_pic_068YHeart Cleaver|"Makes the hearts of your opponents beat faster."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_01_class_2_pic_068\Love Scepter|"Shoots a hot beam of love that will melt any<br>heart." - XOXO your Valentine!item_type_01_class_3_pic_068eEmotional Explosion|"Let it rain hearts. Attention: danger of suffocation!"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_08_pic_068aHalf-hearted Confession of Love|"Forever separated or forever coupled?"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!event_name_salechristmasChristmas Saleevent_name_salenewyearNew Year's Salestarterpack_12_newyear_titleFireworks Packstarterpack_10_christmas_titleChristmas Tree Packstarterpack_11_christmas_titleChristmas Feast Packnot_enough_inventory_space-Your backpack doesn't have enough free space.claim_legendary_rewards_titleClaim Legendary items!dungeon_24_commentN"여기서 공식 영웅 면허증을 긴급히<br> 확인해야 합니다..."	worlds_euEuropegt_daily_bonus_effectqAll <info>treats</info> have an additional effect of <info>+%1%</info> more damage which they add to your weapon.shop_reroll_button%다른 상품 보기(<mushroom> 1개)%blacksmith_label_removestone_possible3<white>보석 추출</white><br>비용:<br>%1<br>%2ultimate_mode_name)<ultimate quote>Ultimate</ultimate quote>%fort_building_dialog_text_can_harvestC%1<br><br><info>비용:</info><br>%2<br><br><info>시간:</info> %3dot_boss_33*Spits fire and bars about Mom's spaghetti.monster_name_5227The Not That Strange Onemonster_name_5229Experimental Chefdot_boss_36}Take an ancient legacy, four drops of blood and a pinch of betrayal, and he already has the perfect recipe for your downfall.dot_boss_34LHe saw in the stars that he has to fight you. However, he has forgotten why.dot_boss_35QWarms the hearts of little orcs, but looking at him will only get you chilblains.reroll_button%다른 상품 보기(<mushroom>%1개)monster_name_5228
